     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Cushing disease: medical tx for persistent disease, recurrence, or as a bridge to definitive tx; pituitary-directed: dopamine agonists (cabergoline), somatostatin analogs (pasireotide); adrenal steroidogenesis inhibitors: metyrapone, mitotane, levoketoconazole, osilodrostat, etomidate; GC receptor blocker mifepristone: approved for Cushing syndrome w hyperglycemia."
     }
    ]
